+Source-proof gaps from the actual review are closed by inspection, not new execution: `execute` passes core.transaction into `evaluateTransaction`, whose scopeEvent copies that transaction; the same core is retained in the completed receipt. `transactionReceiptMaximum()` defaults to TRANSACTION_MAXIMUM_OPERATIONS32; runtime readDefaultItems is2 and maxPageItems32, and read-request accepts limit. Event/default page maximum32 fits these two events; next:null still independently establishes completeness. Full local schema-reference traversal for the five validator roots is recorded in source-proof.json; required formats are uri/date-time, with no product import or Ajv execution claimed. `jsonResponse`, `problem`, `receiptResponse`, and parseReadUpdateShape snapshot/validate without injecting Problem title/detail. The unowned Task recipe has no links or ownedLinks; authority reading validates/reuses stored Resource records and pagination selects the same records rather than adding empty links. Receipt detail expiry is terminal time+86400000ms; normal45s execution is within that policy, but clock jumps/expiry remain unexpected failures, not a new expiry ruling. Symbols and committed hash pins, rather than stale lines, bind these findings.
+
